# Don't stop here, keep learning!

## Additional Resources
* <a href="https://www.teachai.org/" target="_blank">TeachAI.org</a> Empowering educators to teach with and about AI.
* <a href="https://www.teachai.org/ailiteracy" target="_blank">AILit Framework</a> from TeachAI.org.


## Take it Further Activities

Want to learn more? Try out the following optional activities.
  <!-- Dropdown 1 -->
<details style="background-color: #ececec; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 5px;">

<summary style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold">
	Learn More About Generative AI
</summary>

<div style="margin-top: 10px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid #ddd;">
<p style="margin: 5px 0 10px 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5;">Generative AI may seem magical and mysterious, but it’s a lot easier to understand when you break it down to four core components: input, storage, processing, and output. Learn How Generative AI Works in this video series!</p>

<a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLzdnOPI1iJNfJLo5nNGPHo0xCd9Xw5lSs" 
         target="blank" 
         rel="noopener noreferrer" 
         style="display: inline-block; margin-top: 5px; padding: 8px 12px; background-color: #026C7A; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 14px;">Check it Out
</a>
</div>

</details>

  <!-- Dropdown 2 -->
<details style="background-color: #ececec; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 5px;">

<summary style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold">
	Learn How Neural Networks Work
</summary>

<div style="margin-top: 10px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid #ddd;">
<p style="margin: 5px 0 10px 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5;">Watch this video to start learning how Neural Networks work. Then, take your learning to an LLM - prompt the model of your choice to learn more.
</p>

<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JrXazCEACVo" 
         target="blank" 
         rel="noopener noreferrer" 
         style="display: inline-block; margin-top: 5px; padding: 8px 12px; background-color: #026C7A; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 14px;">Check it Out
</a>
</div>

</details>

  <!-- Dropdown 3 -->
<details style="background-color: #ececec; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 5px;">

<summary style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold">
	Bring AI to Your Classroom
</summary>

<div style="margin-top: 10px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid #ddd;">
<p style="margin: 5px 0 10px 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5;">Teach your students how AI really works through short, engaging videos and in-class lessons. This free lesson series breaks down core AI concepts—from machine learning and generative models to ethics and real-world applications. Use one lesson or all seven to spark curiosity and critical thinking.</p>

<a href="https://code.org/en-US/curriculum/how-artificial-intelligence-works" 
         target="blank" 
         rel="noopener noreferrer" 
         style="display: inline-block; margin-top: 5px; padding: 8px 12px; background-color: #026C7A; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 14px;">Check it Out
</a>
</div>

</details>

